  "description": "Issue #18 sprint 4 contract evidence (multi-locale build variant of locale-blank-sram-no-selector-default-modern-debug): booting the EXPANSION_ENABLED_LOCALES=en,qps-ploc EXPANSION_PSEUDO_LOCALE=1 modern debug ROM from a genuinely blank (all-0xFF) SRAM chip STILL never shows the selector, even though enabledLocaleCount=2 here (a build where the selector WOULD be shown for any other 'requires prompt' prefs state -- see locale-selector-multi-switch-qps-modern-debug). This proves the blank-SRAM auto-stamp finding is a property of BuildCurrentExpansionSaveMeta()'s own SAVE_COMPAT_EMPTY handling, not an artifact of a single-enabled-locale AUTO_SELECT collapse.",
